      BackdropKey: Assets/_Project/Art/Backgrounds/Dungeon.png
      Cast: []
      Lines:
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: 'Somewhere between two realities, someone has fenced off a paddock
          and hung a sign: PETTING ZOO.'
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: A sheep chews at the rail. A peacock fans its tail at nobody in particular.
          Two fawns nose at an empty trough, and a cooler of cold ones sweats by
          the gate.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
      - SpeakerId: 
        IsNarration: 1
        Expression: 0
        Side: 0
        Text: Prince's contract says nothing about petting zoos. It doesn't forbid
          them either.
        IsEventSpeaker: 0
        ExpressionName: 
